error: print timeout after 1ms with the turn still in progress; the response is partial
AGY_ERROR: {"short_error":"print timeout after 1ms with the turn still in progress; the response is partial","status":"DEADLINE_EXCEEDED","retryable":false,"reason":"print_timeout"}

## --input-format stream-json: the NDJSON input channel (needs --output-format stream-json)
$ agy ... --input-format stream-json --output-format stream-json --print-timeout 1ms   < {"event":"user","message":"Reply with the word STREAM."}
exit=1
--- stderr:
error: failed to decode stream input: json: cannot unmarshal string into Go struct field StreamInputMessage.message of type printmode.StreamInputUserMessage

$ agy ... --input-format stream-json --output-format stream-json --print-timeout 1ms   < {"event":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Reply with the word STREAM."}}
exit=0      ## note: exit 0 and status SUCCESS although finished_reason is print_timeout
--- stdout:
