## --conversation with an id the CLI does not know: a warning, then a new CLI-made id
$ agy --model gemini-3.8-flash-low --output-format json --print-timeout 1ms --conversation 7a1b2c3d-0000-4000-8000-00000000abcd   < stdin1.txt
exit=3
