## 2. Plan probe: --mode plan, stream-json, prompt on stdin (plan.txt):
## "You are planning only. Read README.md in the current folder. Then write a plan with exactly two
##  numbered steps to add a file named LICENSE. Do not create or change any file.
##  The last line of your final message must be exactly: RALPHY_DONE_EXIT"
